%% Title: Voice Session Lifecycle
%% Description: Full sequence from session start to debrief generation

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant LK as LiveKit Cloud
    participant W as Agent Worker

    U->>FE: Click "Start Room"
    FE->>API: POST /session/start
    API->>API: Create Room + Session in DB
    API->>API: Generate LiveKit JWT Token
    API->>LK: CreateRoom + AgentDispatch
    API-->>FE: {livekit_url, token, session_id}
    FE->>LK: Connect to Room (WebRTC)
    LK->>W: Job Dispatch (room metadata)
    W->>LK: Connect to Room
    W->>LK: Say greeting (Cartesia TTS)
    LK-->>FE: Audio stream + Data channel

    loop Each Debate Turn
        W->>W: route_turn (Groq 8b)
        W->>W: generate_turn (Groq 70b)
        W->>LK: Publish speaker_change
        W->>LK: TTS audio stream
        W->>LK: Publish turn_committed
        LK-->>FE: Data + Audio
        FE->>FE: Update TranscriptFeed
    end

    U->>FE: Click "End Session"
    FE->>API: POST /session/{id}/end
    API->>API: Save transcript + scores
    API-->>FE: {debrief, scores, xp}
    FE->>FE: Navigate to Debrief page
